Version 4
SHEET 1 1700 1050
TEXT 48 16 Left 3 ;Negative undershoot - an assumed RLC network, no I/O clamp
TEXT 48 80 Left 2 ;3.3 V -> 0 V in 2 ns; source resistance 20 ohms; loop L = 100 nH; pin C = 100 pF
SYMBOL voltage 96 256 R0
SYMATTR InstName VIN
SYMATTR Value PWL(0 3.3 50n 3.3 52n 0)
WIRE 96 192 96 272
WIRE 96 352 96 416
FLAG 96 416 0
FLAG 96 192 src
WIRE 96 192 352 192
SYMBOL res 448 176 R90
WINDOW 0 0 32 VBottom 2
WINDOW 3 32 32 VTop 2
SYMATTR InstName RS
SYMATTR Value 20
WIRE 432 192 608 192
SYMBOL ind 704 176 R90
WINDOW 0 0 32 VBottom 2
WINDOW 3 32 32 VTop 2
SYMATTR InstName LP
SYMATTR Value 100n
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser=0
WIRE 688 192 960 192
FLAG 960 192 pin
WIRE 960 192 960 288
SYMBOL cap 944 288 R0
SYMATTR InstName CP
SYMATTR Value 100p
SYMATTR SpiceLine Rser=0
WIRE 960 352 960 416
FLAG 960 416 0
TEXT 48 544 Left 2 !.tran 0 180n 0 100p
TEXT 48 592 Left 2 !.save V(pin) V(src) I(LP)
TEXT 48 640 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=15 reltol=1e-6 vntol=1e-8 abstol=1e-11
TEXT 48 720 Left 2 ;Change RS to 63.2455532034 ohms for the critical-damping comparison.
TEXT 48 768 Left 2 ;These parasitics are assumed, not extracted. This is not an IC absolute-maximum test.
